====================================================================================================
v120  MINIMUM CLIQUE COVER:  is Qiskit's grouper leaving G on the table?
====================================================================================================
  Grouping = clique cover of the commutation graph = COLOURING the
  anticommutation graph. MCC is NP-hard (arXiv:1907.03358), so every
  grouper is a heuristic and its answer is an upper bound.
  TIER C: structural, no circuits.
  networkx available: True

